mf:[{name:"Vishal Dharmadhikari",role:"Product Solutions Engineer"},{name:"Ahmad Awais",role:"Founder & CEO of Langbase"}],thumbnail:{src:"https://www.gstatic.com/aistudio/case_studies/Langbase_hero.jpg",type:"image",alt:"AgentOps showcase hero"}}},{type:"stats",content:{stats:[{value:"31.1 tokens/s",description:"78% higher throughput with Flash vs. comparable models"},{value:"7.8x",description:"larger context window with Flash vs. comparable models"},{value:"28%",description:"Faster response times with Flash vs. comparable models"},
{value:"50%",description:"Lower costs with Flash vs. comparable models"}],APc:['source: <a href="https://langbase.com/blog/google-gemini-surpassed-openai">Langbase blog</a>']}},{type:"cta",content:{link:"https://aistudio.google.com/prompts/new_chat?model=gemini-flash-latest"}},{type:"text",content:{body:'\n            <p>\n              Building AI agents capable of autonomously managing their operations and external tools typically requires navigating integration and infrastructure hurdles. Langbase eliminates the burden of managing these underlying complexities, providing a platform to create and deploy <a href="https://langbase.com/agents">serverless AI agents</a> powered by models like Gemini, all without a framework.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Since the release of <a href="https://deepmind.google/technologies/gemini/flash/">Gemini Flash</a>, Langbase users have quickly realized the performance and cost advantages of using these lightweight models for agentic experiences.</p>'}},
{type:"images",content:{items:[{image:{src:"https://ai.google.dev/static/images/showcase/langbase/langbase-gemini.png",alt:"The Langbase platform shows different Gemini models available to make pipe agents via the Gemini API."}}]}},{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>Achieving scalability and faster AI agents with Gemini Flash</h2>"},body:'\n            <p>\n              The Langbase platform provides access to Gemini models via the <a href="/docs/models/gemini">Gemini API</a>, enabling users to choose fast models that can handle complex tasks and process vast amounts of data. With low latency being critical to delivering a smooth, real-time experience, the Gemini Flash model family is particularly suited to build user-facing agents.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              In addition to 28% faster response times, platform users experienced a 50% reduction in costs and 78% increase in throughput for their operations when using Gemini 1.5 Flash. The ability to handle a large volume of requests without compromising performance makes Gemini Flash models an obvious choice for high-demand applications for use cases such as social media content creation, research paper summarization, and active analysis of medical documents.\n            </p>'}},
{type:"text",content:{header:{headline:"<h2>How Langbase simplifies agent development</h2>"},body:'\n            <p>\n              Langbase is a serverless, composable AI agent development and deployment platform that enables the creation of serverless AI agents. It offers fully managed, scalable semantic retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems known as <a href="https://langbase.com/docs/memory">\u201cmemory agents.\u201d</a> Additional features include workflow orchestration, data management, user interaction handling, and integration with external services.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Powered by models like Gemini 1.5 Flash, <a href="https://langbase.com/docs/pipe/quickstart">\u201cpipe agents\u201d</a> adhere to and act upon specified instructions and have access to powerful tools including web-search and web-crawling. On the other hand, memory agents dynamically access relevant data to generate grounded responses. Langbase\u2019s Pipe and Memory APIs enable developers to build powerful features by connecting powerful reasoning to new data sources, expanding the knowledge and utility of AI models.</p>'}},
{type:"images",content:{items:[{image:{src:"https://ai.google.dev/static/images/showcase/langbase/langbase-gemini-memoryagent.png",alt:"Langbase Memory agents help minimize hallucination and generate data-grounded responses."}}]}},{type:"text",content:{body:'\n            <p>\n              By automating complicated processes, enhancing workflow efficiency, and providing users with highly personalized experiences, AI agents open up possibilities for more powerful applications. The combination of powerful reasoning, low costs, and faster speeds makes Gemini Flash models a preferred choice for Langbase users. Explore the <a href="https://langbase.com/">platform</a> to start building and deploying highly efficient, scalable <a href="https://langbase.com/agents">AI agents</a>.\n            </p>'}},
